+        Args:
+            custom_criteria (:obj:`callable`, optional): A function taking a feature type and returning a
+                :obj:`bool`. ``None`` (default) restores the default behaviour.
+
+        Example::
+            >>> features = Features({"text": Value("string"), "image": Image()})
+            >>> features.set_custom_decoding_criteria(lambda feature: isinstance(feature, Value))
